Description: Apple Magic Mouse 2 driver with macOS-like scrolling and gestures
 Smooth pixel-precise scrolling with inertia, GNOME workspace swipes that
 follow the fingers, macOS-style secondary click, smart zoom and Mission
 Control double taps for the Apple Magic Mouse 2 on Linux.
